ent-CMUActionReaperRevive = Reanimate Xeno
    .desc = Spend 500 flesh to revive a hive sister. Begin within three minutes of death, then channel for two minutes. An accepted reanimation can finish after the freshness window expires. Flesh and the ten-minute cooldown are consumed when charging begins, even if interrupted.
cmu-reaper-revive-too-old = This sister has been dead too long. Begin reanimation within three minutes of death.
cmu-reaper-revive-queen-exists = This hive already has a living Queen. You cannot reanimate another.
cmu-reaper-revive-invalid = You need an unclaimed dead xeno from your hive.
cmu-reaper-revive-start = You bind the fallen sister. Stay still for two minutes.
cmu-reaper-revive-complete = The sister stirs as your vessels withdraw.
cmu-reaper-revive-cancelled = The binding breaks. Your flesh is spent and the cooldown remains.
